    "sentence_translations": [
      "My Mum Is a Doctor",
      "",
      "Li: Sorry, Anne. My mom had too many questions.",
      "",
      "Anne: No worries. I like your mom. Your mom is very pretty, and her questions were all very good.",
      "",
      "Li: Thanks.",
      "",
      "Anne: Your mom went to the hospital. What happened?",
      "",
      "Li: My mom is a doctor. She works at the hospital.",
      "",
      "Anne: My dad is also a doctor. He also works at a hospital! What about your dad? Where does your dad work?",
      "",
      "Li: My dad is a teacher. He works at a school.",
      "",
      "Anne: Teacher? Which school does your dad work at? Your school?",
      "",
      "Li: No, my dad does not work at my school.",
      "",
      "Where is your dad’s school? Is it far? Are there many students? Does your dad like his job?",
      "Ah! Sorry, I also have too many questions.",
      "",
      "Li: No worries. I like your questions.",
      "My dad’s school is very far away. There are not many students. My dad really likes his job."
